IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: nabayaran po yung mga utang, at higit sa lahat po tinulungan namin ma-repair niyang papanong ma-write off na lang yung iba.

3427
02:19:38,580 --> 02:19:45,240
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: Di po, ang tanong ko po, kamusta po ang kulang limandaang empleyado at COS ng IBC-13

3428
02:19:45,820 --> 02:19:50,180
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: nang nalaman nila na wala po kayong pondo itong taon na ito?

3429
02:19:50,440 --> 02:19:56,200
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: Naniniwala po sila sa puso at damdamin ng ating pamahalaan, ng ating lehislatibo.

3430
02:19:59,440 --> 02:20:00,540
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Maasa po sila.

3431
02:20:01,000 --> 02:20:07,040
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Opo, sana po, katulad naman sinabi ng mga kasamahan ko, sana po, mabigyan ng pondo ang IB13.

3432
02:20:08,880 --> 02:20:12,540
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Nakita naman natin kung saan sila nagsimula at nasan sila ngayon.

3433
02:20:12,840 --> 02:20:17,920
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Sabi nga ni Cong. Brian Yamsuan, hanggang sa huli, palagi.

3434
02:20:18,480 --> 02:20:19,100
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Di ba?

3435
02:20:19,620 --> 02:20:23,900
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: At sabi naman ni Chair, ni Madam Chair, ipaglalaban.

3436
02:20:23,900 --> 02:20:25,800
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Mga programa sa TVA, ipaglaban mo.

3437
02:20:26,860 --> 02:20:28,060
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Di ba? So, paglalaban natin yan.

3438
02:20:32,170 --> 02:20:40,650
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: At sa PIA, naku, nung nakita ko yung pictures ng mga bats, alam niyo, ibang-iba eh.

3439
02:20:40,730 --> 02:20:44,290
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Because I live in two different cultures, I see the difference. It's night and day.

3440
02:20:45,030 --> 02:20:48,870
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Bakit kung sa Amerika, kapag ahensya ng pamahalaan ng departamento,

3441
02:20:51,010 --> 02:20:52,470
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: napaka-impressive ang mga gusali, malinis,

3442
02:20:54,210 --> 02:20:56,330
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: matibay, malamig, maganda yung mga furniture.

3443
02:20:57,130 --> 02:21:04,090
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Bakit sa atin, kapag gobyerno, parang hindi inaalagaan ang bahay?

3444
02:21:04,350 --> 02:21:05,790
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Hindi ko maunawaan.

3445
02:21:05,790 --> 02:21:13,590
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And I believe that if you want to change the culture, you want to promote professionalism,

3446
02:21:13,590 --> 02:21:16,270
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: you need a professional environment.

3447
02:21:16,270 --> 02:21:19,030
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And certainly what I saw is not a professional environment.

3448
02:21:19,030 --> 02:21:21,850
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Sana ho, mapagtuunan ng pansin yun.

3449
02:21:21,850 --> 02:21:23,290
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Kaya nung bagong congressman ako,

3450
02:21:23,890 --> 02:21:27,030
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: nung ginawa, pina-renovate ko ang aking opisina,

3451
02:21:27,030 --> 02:21:31,110
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: na sa mahabang panahon, ilang dekada, hindi na-renovate.

3452
02:21:31,730 --> 02:21:37,990
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Kasi kailangan ko ng magandang environment para makapagtrabaho ng mabuti at paglingkuran ang mamamayan.

3453
02:21:38,110 --> 02:21:40,450
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: At sana ganun po gawin natin sa PIA.

3454
02:21:40,590 --> 02:21:41,350
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Maraming salamat po.

3455
02:21:41,530 --> 02:21:44,550
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you very much, Representative Antonino Roman.

3456
02:21:45,230 --> 02:21:47,410
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Our chair calls for a momentary suspension.

3457
02:35:14,030 --> 02:35:19,710
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The committee resumes the hearing for House Bill No. 10858.

3458
02:35:21,130 --> 02:35:21,970
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Chair.

3459
02:35:23,610 --> 02:35:29,350
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The committee now recognizes Representative Antonino Roman for additional interpellation.

3460
02:35:29,590 --> 02:35:35,430
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: For additional interpellation, I’m just curious on, would like to know the reason for defunding IBC 13.

3461
02:35:35,670 --> 02:35:36,690
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Bakit ito nawala ng pondo?

3462
02:35:39,680 --> 02:35:40,880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Secretary Dave.

3463
02:35:41,180 --> 02:35:43,120
Secretary David M. Gomez: Yes, thank you, Your Honor.

3464
02:35:43,120 --> 02:35:55,840
Secretary David M. Gomez: And if again, I may reiterate what I mentioned earlier, we were really very surprised and very saddened when we saw the NEP that was

3465
02:35:55,840 --> 02:36:03,240
Secretary David M. Gomez: submitted to Congress that allocated zero budget for IBC, only to find out that the

3466
02:36:03,240 --> 02:36:07,680
Secretary David M. Gomez: rationale, the reason behind it was the supposed planned privatization of the station.

3467
02:36:08,540 --> 02:36:16,300
Secretary David M. Gomez: We are working, as I mentioned earlier as well, we are working for the privatization of the station.

3468
02:36:16,300 --> 02:36:20,660
Secretary David M. Gomez: And in fact, we're meeting with the GCG next week to finalize the plans.

3469
02:36:20,660 --> 02:36:27,960
Secretary David M. Gomez: But there are several working pieces that we need to put in place first.

3470
02:36:28,680 --> 02:36:35,500
Secretary David M. Gomez: But we're really looking to complete the process by end of the year, but...

3471
02:36:35,500 --> 02:36:37,160
Secretary David M. Gomez: But if

3472
02:36:37,160 --> 02:36:42,340
Secretary David M. Gomez: there are some headwinds that we may encounter, obstacles thrown our way,

3473
02:36:42,620 --> 02:36:50,740
Secretary David M. Gomez: what happens to the station if they don't have any budget by first of January next year? What happens to our employees?

3474
02:36:51,020 --> 02:37:00,400
Secretary David M. Gomez: What happens to our programs? That's why we're really appealing to this honorable committee

3475
02:37:00,400 --> 02:37:06,640
Secretary David M. Gomez: to restore what IBC 13 proposed in their National Expenditure Program.

3476
02:37:06,960 --> 02:37:10,760
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So, sa madaling salita po, nasa initial stages pa lang ng planning,

3477
02:37:10,940 --> 02:37:17,500
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: na malayo pa ho ang mahabang panahon pa ang lilipas bago ma-finalize?

3478
02:37:17,860 --> 02:37:19,720
Secretary David M. Gomez: Hindi naman po, Your Honor, hindi naman po.

3479
02:37:19,780 --> 02:37:38,420
Secretary David M. Gomez: Medyo, simula nung dumating ako dito sa role na ito, nung tinignan namin, medyo matagal na stall, matagal na stall yung privatization initiative. Only now that we are pushing with guidance from the top that we really should prioritize this.

3480
02:37:39,180 --> 02:37:48,580
Secretary David M. Gomez: That we are working now with the station, DBP, and GCG so that finally before the end of the year,

3481
02:37:48,680 --> 02:37:53,700
Secretary David M. Gomez: we can call for an open public bidding for interested parties.

3482
02:37:53,700 --> 02:37:59,040
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So malayo po tayo sa bidding, maaaring mag-fail pa yung bidding, marami pang puwedeng mangyari.

3483
02:38:00,300 --> 02:38:04,820
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Maaaring mawalan ng interes sa mga kinakausap ninyo. Marami pa kayong kakausapin.

3484
02:38:05,340 --> 02:38:11,880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So mukhang mahabang panahon po, ang maraming... ilang buwan pang lilipas bago ma-finalize ito.

3485
02:38:12,300 --> 02:38:18,240
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So masasabi n’yo po na parang premature at napaaga masyado yung pagtanggal ng pondo sa inyo.

3486
02:38:18,540 --> 02:38:20,170
Secretary David M. Gomez: Opo your honor totoo po.

3487
02:38:21,620 --> 02:38:24,660
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Maraming salamat, Congressman Roman. Um,

3488
02:38:25,640 --> 02:38:32,280
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: habang tayo po ay nagsasabi na lahat po tayo ay talagang nadurog ang puso

3489
02:38:32,280 --> 02:38:35,460
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: nang nakita natin ang IBC 13 na nag-zero budget,

3490
02:38:35,740 --> 02:38:43,120
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: nandito lang po pala sa in our midst si DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo.

3491
02:38:43,740 --> 02:38:53,060
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Siya po ay puwede natin tanungin as to the wisdom of the DBM, why it came to be that IBC had zero budget for 2027.

3492
02:38:53,200 --> 02:38:55,600
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Ma’am, we recognize Assistant Director Lulu.

3493
02:38:56,820 --> 02:39:00,740
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Good morning, Madam Chair and Your Honor.

3494
02:39:01,280 --> 02:39:10,680
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Actually, IBC 13 is really currently under the GOCC, which is listed as under privatization.

3495
02:39:10,960 --> 02:39:18,880
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: This is pursuant to the memo of the Executive Secretary, dated December 21, 2015.

3496
02:39:20,360 --> 02:39:27,060
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So, up to now, yun ang tingin ng DBM because it is an ongoing privatization.

3497
02:39:27,200 --> 02:39:28,200
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: But for 2026...

3498
02:39:28,200 --> 02:39:39,800
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: We have released 424 million for the compensation benefits of the IBC 13 employees.

3499
02:39:40,820 --> 02:39:48,360
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So, kung baga, sinusuportahan din naman ng DBM if ever na need talaga na like that.

3500
02:39:48,360 --> 02:39:53,220
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And ang assumption namin is, last na na po yun, nababayaran namin.

3501
02:39:53,460 --> 02:39:56,720
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: considering na yung mga retirement benefits na nabayaran na rin namin.

3502
02:39:56,920 --> 02:39:59,700
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And then, when you speak of yung...

3503
02:39:59,700 --> 02:40:07,340
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: arbitration award, which is in the amount of 50 million, I think that was awarded only in June this year.

3504
02:40:07,580 --> 02:40:10,020
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: E tapos na po ang budget preparation that time.

3505
02:40:10,380 --> 02:40:14,000
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And nag-re-issue na po kami noon ng confirmation letter.

3506
02:40:14,000 --> 02:40:20,000
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: So, possible po talagang hindi siya maisasama sa 2027.

3507
02:40:20,000 --> 02:40:23,200
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: That's our position po.

3508
02:40:23,200 --> 02:40:24,120
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Madam Chair.

3509
02:40:25,560 --> 02:40:26,900
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Thank you, Assistant Director.

3510
02:40:27,460 --> 02:40:30,500
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Chair, is she a resource person also from DBM?

3511
02:40:31,040 --> 02:40:33,360
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Yes, she is assistant, yes.

3512
02:40:33,580 --> 02:40:36,560
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: She's a resource person, therefore I can propound questions to her.

3513
02:40:36,980 --> 02:40:40,100
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Yes, yes, go ahead, Representative Antonino.

3514
02:40:40,260 --> 02:40:43,580
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So, alam niyo yung arbitration award na kailangan mo yan ng 50 million.

3515
02:40:44,520 --> 02:40:46,500
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Tapos, sa kabila nun, dinefund niyo

3516
02:40:46,780 --> 02:40:48,180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So, sino magbabayad noon?

3517
02:40:50,620 --> 02:40:52,900
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Actually, sir, we don't receive any...

3518
02:40:57,740 --> 02:41:00,560
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: I mean, we don't need any record.

3519
02:41:01,240 --> 02:41:03,120
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yeah, we did not receive any record

3520
02:41:03,120 --> 02:41:04,800
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: or any request on that.

3521
02:41:04,940 --> 02:41:08,620
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And we don't have any copy of that arbitration award.

3522
02:41:08,800 --> 02:41:12,740
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: But the DBM was present in the last year's budget deliberations.

3523
02:41:13,020 --> 02:41:19,160
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And that was one of the issues lengthily discussed during the budget deliberations of PCO.

3524
02:41:21,840 --> 02:41:29,120
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: That's why, sir, in 2026, the IBC 13 requested for the compensation benefits.

3525
02:41:30,020 --> 02:41:33,400
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And we granted it out of the Pension Gratuity Fund.

3526
02:41:33,400 --> 02:41:36,140
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: In the amount of 428 million.

3527
02:41:36,440 --> 02:41:43,560
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: But you just said that you found out about the arbitration award came down in June of this year.

3528
02:41:44,100 --> 02:41:45,000
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: This year.

3529
02:41:45,180 --> 02:41:45,480
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yes.

3530
02:41:45,580 --> 02:41:46,820
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And you said it's too late.

3531
02:41:49,520 --> 02:41:54,200
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And the budget prep season is from April up to May.

3532
02:41:54,200 --> 02:41:58,060
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And June is already a final deliberation.

3533
02:41:58,060 --> 02:42:02,440
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And we have to issue our confirmation letter to the agencies.

3534
02:42:02,690 --> 02:42:03,390
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Tapos na po.

3535
02:42:03,530 --> 02:42:05,570
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: But given that this supervening event...

3536
02:42:05,910 --> 02:42:07,840
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Don't you think that requires an amendment?

3537
02:42:09,460 --> 02:42:11,660
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: To satisfy legal obligations?

3538
02:42:12,920 --> 02:42:16,120
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Sir, it's up to the Congress, po.

3539
02:42:16,360 --> 02:42:19,760
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Pero don't you think it's wrong for government not to pay legal obligations?

3540
02:42:19,980 --> 02:42:21,480
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: That government should set an example?

3541
02:42:22,120 --> 02:42:29,940
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Sir, like what we did in 2026 when they requested for the compensation benefits of those IBC employees,

3542
02:42:30,440 --> 02:42:33,020
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: we granted them 428 million.

3543
02:42:33,020 --> 02:42:35,880
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: And that is charged against the Pension and Gratuity Fund, po.

3544
02:42:36,120 --> 02:42:37,220
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Were you present earlier?

3545
02:42:37,220 --> 02:42:38,340
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: During the discussions here?

3546
02:42:40,940 --> 02:42:41,540
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yes.

3547
02:42:41,620 --> 02:42:42,280
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Yes, you were.

3548
02:42:42,400 --> 02:42:45,160
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: You heard the sentiments and the views of the congressmen here?

3549
02:42:45,180 --> 02:42:45,500
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yes, Your Honor.

3550
02:42:46,280 --> 02:42:48,180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And you appreciate where we're coming from?

3551
02:42:49,320 --> 02:42:49,780
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Okay.

3552
02:42:50,280 --> 02:42:51,260
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Maraming salamat po.

3553
02:42:53,640 --> 02:43:00,840
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, that Assistant Director, should we, should the IBC or Secretary Dave, like, write another

3554
02:43:00,840 --> 02:43:01,440
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: remedy?

3555
02:43:01,960 --> 02:43:05,580
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Because you said, na-receive niyo po June 2026.

3556
02:43:06,100 --> 02:43:06,721
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, just...

3557
02:43:06,721 --> 02:43:11,040
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: We did not receive any letter or any approval of that, Your Honor.

3558
02:43:11,520 --> 02:43:17,960
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Wala ho kaming copy. Kaya we did not, we didn't know na meron palang gano'n na. Yes, yes po.

3559
02:43:18,400 --> 02:43:25,960
Secretary David M. Gomez: Madam Chairman, if I may add, no, I will concur with the report of the Director.

3560
02:43:26,720 --> 02:43:33,880
Secretary David M. Gomez: By June 30 this year, tapos na po yung preparation ng NEP, no, na-discuss na po sa cabinet, na-present na po sa Pangulo yun.

3561
02:43:34,000 --> 02:43:36,960
Secretary David M. Gomez: So, medyo, hindi nga siguro umabot, no.

3562
02:43:37,580 --> 02:43:40,180
Secretary David M. Gomez: But tama din po si Congressman na

3563
02:43:40,180 --> 02:43:43,900
Secretary David M. Gomez: This is a legal obligation that IBC 13 needs to settle.

3564
02:43:43,900 --> 02:43:49,280
Secretary David M. Gomez: So, isasama na lang po namin doon sa summary namin of the budget

3565
02:43:49,280 --> 02:43:55,200
Secretary David M. Gomez: proposed by the attached agencies that were cut or were not included, but we respectfully

3566
02:43:55,200 --> 02:43:57,620
Secretary David M. Gomez: ask the committee to restore or to fund.

3567
02:43:58,160 --> 02:43:58,860
Secretary David M. Gomez: Salamat, po.

3568
02:43:59,280 --> 02:44:01,300
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you very much, Secretary Dave.

3569
02:44:01,360 --> 02:44:06,620
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, it will all be included in the new quotation. Isasubmit niyo po sa

3570
02:44:06,620 --> 02:44:07,380
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: committee.

3571
02:44:08,540 --> 02:44:08,880
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Okay.

3572
02:44:09,200 --> 02:44:11,020
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, um...

3573
02:44:11,020 --> 02:44:13,020
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, Chair, calls for another suspension.

3574
03:07:06,790 --> 03:07:19,500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Chair, since I guess wala namang ibang magtatanong, with that I move to terminate the budget briefing of Presidential Communications Office.

3575
03:07:20,620 --> 03:07:21,780
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Second the motion.

3576
03:07:21,920 --> 03:07:34,820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Budget hearing of Presidential, the fiscal year budget 2027 of Presidential Commission's Office, including its attached agencies and corporation, Madam Chair.

3577
03:07:35,060 --> 03:07:36,000
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Second, Madam Chair.

3578
03:07:36,580 --> 03:07:43,880
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: It has been moved and duly seconded to terminate the hearing on the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the PCO.

3579
03:07:44,000 --> 03:07:45,120
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Is there any objection?

3580
03:07:46,240 --> 03:07:47,760
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The Chair hears none.

3581
03:07:47,900 --> 03:07:49,000
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The motion is approved.

3582
03:07:49,980 --> 03:07:57,120
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you, Your Honors, and our colleagues from the Presidential Communications Office for your valuable participation in today's budget hearing.

3583
03:07:57,360 --> 03:07:59,640
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Congratulations to the whole PCO family.

3584
03:07:59,760 --> 03:08:00,480
Secretary David M. Gomez: Maraming salamat po.

3585
03:08:01,998 --> 03:08:06,352
Secretary David M. Gomez: ...

3586
03:08:07,280 --> 03:08:09,389
Secretary David M. Gomez: ...

3587
03:08:09,560 --> 03:08:16,180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Chair, with that I would like to move for the suspension of the budget.

3588
03:08:17,200 --> 03:08:19,000
Committee Secretary: Ma'am, ito, ma'am, ito, basahin mo lang 'yan.

3589
03:08:19,020 --> 03:08:30,780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I move to suspend the committee hearing here at Andaya Hall on House Bill No. 10858 until Tuesday, September 1, 2026 at 9 a.m.

3590
03:08:30,780 --> 03:08:31,620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So move, Madam Chair.

3591
03:08:31,880 --> 03:08:33,020
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Second, Madam Chair.

3592
03:08:34,200 --> 03:08:34,800
Committee Secretary: Ma'am, ruling na.

3593
03:08:35,200 --> 03:08:35,660
Committee Secretary: Ruling na.

3594
03:08:35,832 --> 03:08:36,180
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Okay.

3595
03:08:36,828 --> 03:08:37,891
Committee Secretary: Has been moved, ma'am.

3596
03:08:37,891 --> 03:08:39,480
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Has been moved and duly seconded.

3597
03:08:39,700 --> 03:08:40,740
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Is there any objection?

3598
03:08:41,120 --> 03:08:41,900
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Chair hears none.

3599
03:08:42,220 --> 03:08:43,360
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The motion is approved.

3600
03:08:45,340 --> 03:08:46,460
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you.

